@startuml
title Nimbus 分片上传相关模块关系图

class "分片参数解析\nparseChunkExtra_" as ParseChunkExtra {
    +bool parseChunkExtra_(extra, uploadId, index, total, fullSize, chunkSize)
}

class "分片临时目录\nchunkBaseDir_" as ChunkBaseDir {
    +std::string chunkBaseDir_()
}
class "合并后目录\nmergedBaseDir_" as MergedBaseDir {
    +std::string mergedBaseDir_()
}
class "确保目录存在\nensureDir_" as EnsureDir {
    +bool ensureDir_(path)
}
class "判断文件存在\nfileExists_" as FileExists {
    +bool fileExists_(path)
}
class "获取文件大小\nfileSize_" as FileSize {
    +uint64_t fileSize_(path)
}
class "合并分片\nmergeParts_" as MergeParts {
    +bool mergeParts_(sessionDir, mergedPath, totalParts, fullSize)
}
class "清理会话\ncleanupSession_" as CleanupSession {
    +void cleanupSession_(sessionDir, mergedPath, totalParts)
}

ParseChunkExtra ..> ChunkBaseDir : 解析参数后用到
ParseChunkExtra ..> MergedBaseDir
MergeParts ..> EnsureDir : 依赖
MergeParts ..> FileExists : 校验
MergeParts ..> FileSize : 校验
CleanupSession ..> FileExists : 删除分片
CleanupSession ..> EnsureDir : 删除目录

note right of ParseChunkExtra
负责解析分片上传的 extra 字符串，
提取 uploadId、index、total、fullSize、chunkSize
end note

note right of MergeParts
合并所有分片为一个完整文件，
并校验合并后文件大小
end note

note right of CleanupSession
清理分片目录和合并文件
end note

@enduml